{
  "name": "[Agent] Doorbell - deal created or stage changed -> deal-sync relay",
  "description": "AGENT DOORBELL - managed by ops/deal-relay/doorbell/apply_doorbell.py (aplus-agents). Deterministic, no business logic: every new deal, and every deal-stage change, POSTs to the deal-sync-relay worker, which coalesces the burst and dispatches email-deal-sync.yml about a minute later (Teachworks upsert, family SMS/email, scheduler ownership). Replaces the HubSpot private-app webhook that was never configured. Do not add steps here; the fleet owns the logic.",
